# --- Maqwad Frontend env ---

# Base URL of the .NET API. Swagger confirms all real routes are mounted
# under /api (e.g. /api/Users), so the /api prefix belongs here, NOT on the
# individual endpoint paths used throughout the app.
# NOTE: this is http, not https. Fine for local dev, but if the app is ever
# deployed over https, this must be switched to an https backend URL or the
# browser will block the requests as mixed content.
# A local .env may temporarily set this to /api to route through the Vite
# dev proxy (see vite.config.ts) while the backend lacks CORS support for
# the dev origin. Keep this example file pointing at the real absolute URL —
# it's the canonical value for new devs and for production builds.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://miqwad-test.runasp.net/api

# Toggle the in-process mock adapter for /auth/* and /users/me.
# Set to "true" to use mocks (no backend needed); "false" to call the real
# backend at VITE_API_BASE_URL above.
VITE_USE_MOCKS=true

# Google Maps Platform Browser API Key (Optional / Progressive Enhancement)
# Used for genuine Google Places Autocomplete and integrated Google Map during City creation in the Admin Portal.
# Google Cloud Platform Setup Requirements:
# 1. Google Cloud Project & Billing:
#    - Enable billing on your Google Cloud Project (mandatory for Google Maps Platform, includes monthly free tier).
# 2. Required APIs to Enable in Google Cloud Console:
#    - Maps JavaScript API (for interactive map and marker controls)
#    - Places API (New) (for modern PlaceAutocompleteElement and Place.fetchFields)
# 3. Security & Key Restriction Requirements:
#    - This is a client-side (browser) key bundled into the frontend. NEVER put server secrets here.
#    - Application Restrictions (HTTP referrers):
#        * Local development: http://localhost:*/*, http://127.0.0.1:*/*
#        * Production: https://your-production-domain.com/*, https://*.runasp.net/*
#    - API Restrictions:
#        * Restrict the key to ONLY "Maps JavaScript API" and "Places API" / "Places API (New)".
# 4. Graceful Fallback:
#    - If left unset, the City creation form displays a clear "Configuration Required" status
#      informing the administrator that city verification is unavailable until configured.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
